# Engineering Skills

Purpose:
  Systems-engineering knowledge distilled from 2026 landscape research
  (rounds 2-3): memory architecture, deep research, orchestration
  hardening, MCP runtime. Each skill carries its research provenance.

Owns: ./

Skills:
  memory-architecture.sdd:
    one_line: Agent memory architecture patterns — tiering, write paths,
      supersession, fused retrieval, governance primitives
    provenance: research round 3 r1 (2026-09-07; Mem0/Letta/Zep/Graphiti/
      MemOS/VMG patterns, sources in memory upgrades)

  deep-research-pipeline.sdd:
    one_line: Deep research pipeline — scope/perspective/search/learn/
      recurse/verify/compress/write with citation gates
    provenance: research round 3 r2 (2026-09-07; dzhng/LangChain/Anthropic/
      STORM patterns, sources in arms/research.sdd)

  orchestration-hardening.sdd:
    one_line: Multi-agent orchestration reliability — checkpoints,
      interrupts, tiered loop caps, circuit breakers, typed outcomes
    provenance: research round 3 r3 (2026-09-07; LangGraph/Temporal/UMAF/
      Cognition patterns, sources in state.sdd + contract.sdd additions)

  mcp-runtime-ops.sdd:
    one_line: MCP server operations — allowlist activation, hash
      pinning, DLP scanning, sandbox profiles
    provenance: research round 3 r4 (2026-09-07; OWASP MCP Top 10/
      NSA-CISA/mcp-scan patterns, sources in mcp-allowlist.sdd)

  integration-routing.sdd:
    one_line: Ordered backend routing + real health probing + credential
      boundaries for external integrations
    provenance: Agent-Reach analysis (2026-09-10; MIT —
      https://github.com/Panniantong/Agent-Reach; probe/doctor/routing
      patterns, cited in runtime/integration-routing.sdd)

Rules:
  [ENG1] These skills operationalize runtime specs — when skill and spec
         diverge, the spec (.sdd/runtime/, .sdd/chains/) wins.
  [ENG2] Every pattern carries its research-round provenance citation.
  [ENG3] New engineering skills require a weak-point-map justification.

Navigation:
